cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this dataset, please cite both the dataset and the tool that
  produced it (see CITATION.cff at the repository root).
type: dataset
title: "Civic-Tech Corpus — 2026-05 Refresh (n = 55)"
abstract: >-
  A curated corpus of 55 open-source civic-technology repositories from 24
  organisations across five continents (North America, Africa, Japan, Taiwan,
  Europe), crawled 2026-05-21 to 2026-05-24. Each repository carries
  repository-level metrics, per-(repository, contributor) commit counts with a
  heuristic bot flag, PR and tag/release cadence, full-history weekly snapshots,
  per-(contributor, ISO-week) activity (commits + lines added/removed), 45+
  CHAOSS metrics including bus factor, elephant factor, HHI, and burstiness,
  and issue analytics. Companion analyses (statistical_analysis/,
  weekly_activity_analysis/) and synthesis figures are included.
